			"notes": "# Version 0.0.1-b.1 Release notes\n\n## Features\n### Chopping Block\n* Added the Chopping Block, a new functional block that makes it easier to craft wood related blocks.\n  * Added Chopping Block recipe, 2 logs of any type next to each other.\n  * Added recipes for logs to planks, slabs, stairs and wood blocks to the Chopping Block.\n  * Added stripped wood recipes to the Chopping Block.\n  * Added planks slab and stairs from planks recipes to the Chopping Block.\n  * Added door and trapdoor from planks recipes to the Chopping Block.\n  * Added fence and fence gate from planks recipes to the Chopping Block.\n  * Added signs from planks recipes to the Chopping Block.\n  * Added bamboo mosaic from bamboo planks recipes to the Chopping Block.\n### Wooden Mosaic set\n* Added Wooden Mosaic blocks for each wood type.\n  * Added Wooden Mosaic blocks recipe by 2 wood slabs of the same wood type on top of each other.\n* Added Wooden Mosaic Stairs for each wood type.\n  * Added Wooden Mosaic Stairs recipe by 7 wood mosaic of the same wood type int the stair shape.\n* Added Wooden Mosaic Slab for each wood type.\n  * Added Wooden Mosaic Slab recipe by 3 wood mosaic of the same wood type next to each other.\n* Added chopping recipes for all mosaic blocks, stairs and slabs from planks.\n* Added chopping recipes for all mosaic stairs, and slabs from mosaic blocks.\n* Added Chiseled Wood blocks for each wood type.\n  * Added crafting recipe for Chiseled Wood with 2 mosaic and 2 stripped logs of the same wood type.\n### Chiseled Wood Blocks\n* Added Chiseled Wood blocks for each wood type.\n  * Added crafting recipe for Chiseled Wood with 2 mosaic and 2 stripped logs of the same wood type.\n* Added chopping recipes for all Chiseled Wood from Stripped Logs.\n### Lumberjack\n* Added new Lumberjack villager type.\n  * Lumberjack villager uses chopping block as work station.\n* Added plains Lumberjack lodge to plains villages.\n* Added snowy village lumberjack lodge.\n* Added 2 taiga village lumberjack lodges.\n* Added taiga village lumberjack chopping spot.\n* Added savanna village lumberjack lodge.\n* Added desert village lumberjack lodge.\n* Added biome specific chest loot to Lumberjack lodges.\n### Wooden Tile set\n* Added Wooden Tile blocks for each wood type.\n  * Added Wooden Mosaic blocks recipe by 2 wood mosaic slabs of the same wood type on top of each other.\n* Added Wooden Tile Stairs for each wood type.\n  * Added Wooden Tile Stairs recipe by 7 wood tiles of the same wood type int the stair shape.\n* Added Wooden Tile Slab for each wood type.\n  * Added Wooden Tile Slab recipe by 3 wood tiles of the same wood type next to each other.\n* Added chopping recipes for all tile blocks, stairs and slabs from mosaic blocks.\n* Added chopping recipes for all tile stairs, and slabs from tile blocks."
		},
